<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sinclair started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sinclair started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Sinclair Broadcast Group Inc as near-term neutral, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Sinclair remained unchanged at 23-3/4.</p>
</text>
